1
00:00:00,330 --> 00:00:01,840
You know,

2
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:03,670
you're going to make a great actor.

3
00:00:03,670 --> 00:00:04,500
An actor?!

4
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:06,130
Your words have the power to move people.

5
00:00:06,130 --> 00:00:07,460
Huh?

6
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:12,350
Try reading this line.

7
00:00:12,350 --> 00:00:13,560
No, I can't.

8
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:14,680
I could never act.

9
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:16,270
Just read it.

10
00:00:16,270 --> 00:00:17,480
Please.

11
00:00:23,270 --> 00:00:25,110
(What is with this guy?)

12
00:00:25,110 --> 00:00:26,320
(He's definitely a weirdo.)

13
00:00:29,650 --> 00:00:32,160
Give me excess of it,

14
00:00:32,620 --> 00:00:34,660
That, surfeiting,

15
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:37,080
The appetite may sicken,

16
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:39,830
And so die.

17
00:00:39,830 --> 00:00:41,120
Read it.

18
00:00:41,120 --> 00:00:42,830
Please.

19
00:00:43,170 --> 00:00:44,090
(But...)

20
00:00:44,090 --> 00:00:46,050
(That was actually amazing...)

21
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:53,600
Shakespeare's comedy, Twelfth Night.

22
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:55,930
It's a story of Viola, Duke Orsino,

23
00:00:55,930 --> 00:00:59,350
and Princess Olivia, woven with love
and misunderstandings.

24
00:00:59,350 --> 00:01:00,640
Viola, who is a woman,

25
00:01:00,640 --> 00:01:02,480
disguises herself as a man

26
00:01:02,480 --> 00:01:04,400
to serve Duke Orsino.

27
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:06,940
But in truth, Viola secretly

28
00:01:06,940 --> 00:01:09,490
harbors feelings for the Duke...

29
00:01:09,490 --> 00:01:10,980
That's the story.

30
00:01:12,280 --> 00:01:13,080
What do you think?!

31
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:13,990
Um...

32
00:01:13,990 --> 00:01:15,410
It's our next play.

33
00:01:15,410 --> 00:01:17,870
Oh, no, that's okay.

34
00:01:17,870 --> 00:01:18,950
Thank you.

35
00:01:19,200 --> 00:01:20,460
Here, take this.

36
00:01:20,460 --> 00:01:21,460
(Club Application Form)

37
00:01:21,660 --> 00:01:23,120
No, I can't.

38
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:23,920
I could never act.

39
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:26,210
Who decided you can't do it?
Don't sell yourself short.

40
00:01:26,590 --> 00:01:28,250
Speaking in front of people...

41
00:01:28,250 --> 00:01:30,010
I'm not like you, senpai...

42
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:32,220
Don't call me senpai.

43
00:01:32,720 --> 00:01:34,390
Just call me Haru.

44
00:01:35,140 --> 00:01:37,010
That's not what I meant...

45
00:01:37,010 --> 00:01:38,810
You

46
00:01:38,810 --> 00:01:41,180
will definitely shine
on stage.

47
00:01:42,810 --> 00:01:43,940
Haru senpai!

48
00:01:44,600 --> 00:01:46,310
Kaede-san is looking for you.

49
00:01:46,310 --> 00:01:47,940
Oh, I wonder what it is.

50
00:01:47,940 --> 00:01:49,650
I'll be waiting.

51
00:01:53,030 --> 00:01:55,910
Hey, I told you I can't do it!

52
00:02:12,670 --> 00:02:15,720
If music be the food of love...
